Wed Oct 28 16:34:14 UTC 2026 - Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>

- The shipped binary talks to org.freedesktop.portal.* (file chooser,
  screen share), but no portal frontend was declared, so those
  features fail with "No such interface" on a minimal install.
  Add weak Recommends on xdg-desktop-portal and
  xdg-desktop-portal-gtk - never a hard dependency on a desktop
  stack.

Wed Oct 28 05:53:58 UTC 2026 - Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>

- Declare libpulse.so.0 and libpipewire-0.3.so.0: the bundled Electron
  payload references both for Chromium audio output and the upstream RPM
  declares pulseaudio-libs/pipewire-libs, but /opt/Heroic is excluded from
  automatic dependency generation, so they were silently unlisted.

